(text "Console rev A. Every connection is by net label.\nPin map = firmware/board.py (BOARD waveshare): gen.py check.\nPanel: ZJY130T-IF05, 1.3in 240x240 ST7789VW, 4-wire SPI (IM1/2 high).\nJ2 contact k = panel pin 25-k (see README.md)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 101.6 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e27dd984-7b98-4958-a3ee-a21b622e1635"))
(text "Key port (key-c, PROPOSALS.md): U2 limits current and is\nswitched by GP6; D1 keeps a charger's 5 V off KEY_PWR;\npull-ups go to KEY_PWR, never 3V3; CC1/CC2 are read\nseparately on GP27/GP28 through 10k Rp each." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 276.86 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e003ec83-7fa9-4412-a5c9-aec1aace559e"))
